00:00.001 --> 00:00.002
♪Crisis!!

00:00.001 --> 00:00.002
♪Dramatic!

00:00.001 --> 00:00.002
♪...who knows.

00:00.003 --> 00:00.004
♪Doga

00:00.003 --> 00:00.004
♪Squats 50 x 3 sets

00:00.003 --> 00:00.004
♪Florsheim Monster

00:00.003 --> 00:00.004
♪General Vamp!

00:00.003 --> 00:00.004
♪Death Match at Futako-tamagawa

00:00.005 --> 00:00.006
♪2 years ago in China

00:00.005 --> 00:00.006
♪in the morning and evening!!

00:00.005 --> 00:00.006
♪Tizer

00:00.005 --> 00:00.006
♪Fin

00:00.005 --> 00:00.006
♪Food Plaza

00:00.005 --> 00:01.600
♪FIND OUT ON THE WEB

00:00.007 --> 00:00.008
♪Monster Monster

00:00.007 --> 00:00.008
♪We got married

00:00.007 --> 00:00.008
♪Short Corner

00:00.007 --> 00:00.008
♪Astro Fighter Sunred

00:00.007 --> 00:00.008
♪A. That's the rule of evil

00:14.900 --> 00:18.160
What on earth am I
doing in a place like this?

00:19.200 --> 00:21.559
It's already been two
years since I left China,

00:21.560 --> 00:23.290
yet I haven't achieved anything at all.

00:26.470 --> 00:28.669
You want to go to Japan?

00:28.670 --> 00:31.129
I want to rule the world someday!

00:31.130 --> 00:32.459
So I want to first take over Asia,

00:32.460 --> 00:33.949
and to do that I have to go
to its most advanced country...

00:33.950 --> 00:35.309
Don't be ridiculous!

00:35.310 --> 00:36.810
Please don't hurt him, honey!

00:37.500 --> 00:39.059
You want to go to Japan you say?

00:39.060 --> 00:40.699
You want to conquer the world you say?

00:40.700 --> 00:42.659
Quit living in a dream!

00:42.660 --> 00:44.819
You shouldn't worry about anything
but taking over the restaurant!

00:44.820 --> 00:47.029
Why can't you just let
Yang take over the store?

00:47.030 --> 00:49.159
I expected better from my first son!

00:49.160 --> 00:50.439
Stop, honey!

00:50.440 --> 00:51.699
What the hell...

00:51.700 --> 00:53.449
Are first sons not even allowed to dream?

00:53.450 --> 00:54.859
What did you say?

00:54.860 --> 00:56.940
I don't need this, I'm leaving home!

00:58.910 --> 00:59.910
Doga!

01:00.170 --> 01:01.270
Let him go!

01:03.250 --> 01:04.399
God damn it all!

01:04.400 --> 01:06.160
I hate you dad!

01:08.790 --> 01:12.100
I was so passionate back then.

01:15.140 --> 01:16.359
This is it!

01:16.360 --> 01:18.816
I'm going to wake up at six
o'clock every morning from now on!

01:18.840 --> 01:19.840
I can do this!

01:20.690 --> 01:23.849
What happened to that resolution?

01:23.850 --> 01:25.370
I haven't even kept it once this year.

01:26.290 --> 01:29.210
I don't even feel guilty
looking at that paper anymore.

01:30.210 --> 01:32.469
All I do now is sleep
in until it's almost noon.

01:32.470 --> 01:33.640
What's wrong with me?

01:34.460 --> 01:39.799
I just make enough money to get
by and then waste time being a slob.

01:39.800 --> 01:41.590
Would you like me to
warm up your bento box?

01:42.860 --> 01:45.000
What's with all the phony smiles?

01:46.530 --> 01:51.390
I just keep spoiling myself
by taking the easy way out.

02:08.570 --> 02:09.589
No!

02:09.590 --> 02:10.789
I can't! I can't!

02:10.790 --> 02:15.399
I should at least be doing some
pushups if I have time to fantasize.

02:15.400 --> 02:17.700
Make some effort toward
conquering the world!

02:19.610 --> 02:21.960
Why am I sleeping?

02:23.140 --> 02:31.099
I shouldn't be making up excuses for myself even
if I have to wake up early for work tomorrow.

02:31.100 --> 02:32.630
Wake up, me!

02:34.000 --> 02:40.290
How many more regretful nights
must I spend until I can get my peace?

02:44.960 --> 02:45.700
What?

02:45.701 --> 02:48.669
Is there really an organization
plotting world domination in this town?

02:48.670 --> 02:53.559
Yeah. I heard some organization called Florsheim
is fighting against a friend of justice.

02:53.560 --> 02:54.500
A-And?

02:54.501 --> 02:56.019
They're not far from here.

02:56.020 --> 02:58.710
Their base is next to the cleaners
by the third block... Ah, Doga!

03:00.960 --> 03:03.260
I may be worthless and pathetic now,

03:04.320 --> 03:06.300
but there's still hope for me.

03:06.830 --> 03:07.830
I can still do it.

03:08.660 --> 03:11.289
I'll work my way into that organization,

03:11.290 --> 03:12.720
to make my dream come true!

03:19.460 --> 03:21.280
Where were we fighting him today?

03:21.680 --> 03:23.219
At the park on the second block.

03:23.220 --> 03:25.409
It's starting to pour, Master Vamp.

03:25.410 --> 03:28.289
I guess it's really coming down.

03:28.290 --> 03:29.879
What do you want to do, Master Vamp?

03:29.880 --> 03:31.279
Should we take our raincoats?

03:31.280 --> 03:32.429
Raincoat, raincoat!

03:32.430 --> 03:35.429
Let's save world
domination for another day.

03:35.430 --> 03:37.889
We can't afford to catch a cold either.

03:37.890 --> 03:40.919
Yeah. Mr. Red would never show
up in this kind of weather anyway.

03:40.920 --> 03:42.190
Come on guys, let's head back.

03:42.680 --> 03:44.170
Who wants hot chocolate?

03:44.430 --> 03:45.450
Me!

03:46.280 --> 03:47.280
Rain, rain.

04:00.010 --> 04:01.180
I'll start on it tomorrow.

05:32.130 --> 05:32.680
Crisis!!

05:33.150 --> 05:34.500
General Vamp!

05:35.770 --> 05:38.749
I don't know what I'd do if I'd lost it.

05:38.750 --> 05:41.119
We do keep an eye out for
valuables and lost belongings,

05:41.120 --> 05:42.879
but when it comes to
actually finding them...

05:42.880 --> 05:45.050
What should I do...

05:47.900 --> 05:50.449
Is this what you left back in the cabin?

05:50.450 --> 05:52.130
Yes, that's it!

06:01.000 --> 06:03.849
We Florsheim must today rid
ourselves of our mortal enemy,

06:03.850 --> 06:06.380
Astro Fighter Sunred.

06:07.230 --> 06:11.810
With him out of the way, we will move
even closer to achieving world domination!

06:14.210 --> 06:15.760
Florsheim, sally forth!

06:19.150 --> 06:24.310
One, two, one, two...

06:25.180 --> 06:28.920
The train bound for Oshiage
will now be departing.

06:33.370 --> 06:36.119
Do you think Red's really at the
Takajima-en department store?

06:36.120 --> 06:38.850
Kayoko wouldn't lie to us.

06:39.310 --> 06:40.719
Oh Vamp?

06:40.720 --> 06:43.209
Thank you so much
for helping out last time.

06:43.210 --> 06:44.379
No, not at all.

06:44.380 --> 06:45.979
Oh, him?

06:45.980 --> 06:47.440
Well today, he...

06:49.610 --> 06:53.720
Sunred, I can't wait to find
out what your blood smells like.

06:56.460 --> 06:58.900
Gadgem, please don't
do that inside the train.

06:58.940 --> 07:00.229
Oh, sorry.

07:00.230 --> 07:02.439
They're going to think
you're a suspicious person.

07:02.440 --> 07:04.459
Save it for when you meet Mr. Red.

07:04.460 --> 07:06.539
I'm sorry, I just couldn't
help saying it out loud.

07:06.540 --> 07:08.579
But I'm glad to see
that you're enthusiastic.

07:08.580 --> 07:11.379
I'm going to be counting on you
and your 100x magnified dog's nose

07:11.380 --> 07:13.769
to find Mr. Red when we
get to Takajima-en okay?

07:13.770 --> 07:15.199
Please do!

07:15.200 --> 07:19.429
Master Vamp, it'll be much faster for us to get to
Nikotama if we moved to the front cars of the train.

07:19.430 --> 07:21.240
Oh yeah, you're right.

07:21.830 --> 07:23.819
Let's move up then.

07:23.820 --> 07:24.869
Time is money.

07:24.870 --> 07:26.049
Excuse me.

07:26.050 --> 07:27.360
Coming through.

07:27.570 --> 07:30.540
This is Futako-tamagawa,
Futako-tamagawa station.

07:30.860 --> 07:31.530
All right.

07:31.531 --> 07:33.390
Let's get busy with it!

07:35.940 --> 07:36.970
Welcome to Takajima-en!

07:36.640 --> 07:38.139
He's probably... in the lower levels.

07:38.140 --> 07:39.520
Keep it coming!

07:40.410 --> 07:43.869
His scent is getting stronger...
I think he's right up ahead!

07:43.870 --> 07:46.170
Relax, relax. Let's mellow out a little.

07:48.070 --> 07:49.269
There he is!

07:49.270 --> 07:52.290
We've found you, Astro Fighter Sunred!

07:52.430 --> 07:55.200
Oh, it's you guys again.

07:55.450 --> 07:57.749
Sunred, today you will surely face-

07:57.750 --> 07:59.049
Piss off!

07:59.050 --> 08:00.829
Can't you tell what's going on here?

08:00.830 --> 08:02.709
I've got no time to be
playing games with you guys.

08:02.710 --> 08:03.560
My name is...!!

08:03.561 --> 08:05.020
I said piss off!

08:09.310 --> 08:12.080
Um, what's everyone in line for?

08:14.580 --> 08:17.319
They were saying that the melon
bread here is selling like hotcakes,

08:17.320 --> 08:20.369
so Kayoko asked me to buy some for her.

08:20.370 --> 08:22.679
Hey, who's this Kayoko person?

08:22.680 --> 08:23.859
I think Master Vamp
mentioned her name earlier too.

08:23.860 --> 08:25.529
Oh, she's Mr. Red's girlfriend.

08:25.530 --> 08:28.019
She works at an insurance firm.

08:28.020 --> 08:29.789
Is that you, Vamp?

08:29.790 --> 08:31.439
Oh, Mrs. Takeuchi!

08:31.440 --> 08:33.169
It's been so long!

08:33.170 --> 08:35.679
I don't see you around the
neighborhood very often these days.

08:35.680 --> 08:38.159
Indeed. Are you in line for
melon bread too, Mrs. Takeuchi?

08:38.160 --> 08:42.949
Yes indeed. I saw it advertised on the news
last night and I couldn't help but try one!

08:42.950 --> 08:45.129
It's more expensive than the
bread you get at the supermarket,

08:45.130 --> 08:47.690
but I guess it's much
cheaper than buying a cake.

08:45.410 --> 08:46.410
Master Vamp.

08:47.690 --> 08:48.630
That's right

08:48.270 --> 08:49.270
Master Vamp!

08:49.870 --> 08:52.349
What should we do about attacking Red?

08:52.350 --> 08:54.479
Well, what <i>can</i> we do?

08:54.480 --> 08:56.289
It's kind of a difficult stuation here.

08:56.290 --> 08:58.439
There's people around, you know.

08:58.440 --> 09:00.779
Why don't we wait around
until Mr. Red's done.

09:00.780 --> 09:01.810
Sounds like a plan.

09:02.240 --> 09:03.240
Excuse me.

09:03.930 --> 09:06.359
We're getting in the way standing here.

09:06.360 --> 09:06.840
You're right.

09:07.240 --> 09:09.040
What should we do...

09:09.410 --> 09:11.120
Um, Mr. Red?

09:11.950 --> 09:13.389
How much longer do you think it'll be?

09:13.390 --> 09:14.250
How would I know?

09:14.251 --> 09:15.540
Ask the store, not me!

09:16.060 --> 09:21.629
It's going to take at least forty-five minutes
to an hour until the next batch is ready.

09:21.630 --> 09:23.369
Oh, okay.

09:23.370 --> 09:25.469
I guess it's going to be a while then.

09:25.470 --> 09:28.709
Why don't we look around
the upper floors while we wait?

09:28.710 --> 09:33.429
Hey Mr. Red, they said it's going
to take at least forty-five minutes,

09:33.430 --> 09:35.310
so we'll be back around that time.

09:36.150 --> 09:38.069
Um, Master Vamp?

09:38.070 --> 09:39.749
Do you mind if we go look at some clothes?

09:39.750 --> 09:41.289
Sure, sure, go right ahead.

09:41.290 --> 09:43.799
I don't understand young
peoples' fashion nowadays.

09:43.800 --> 09:44.800
Excuse us.

09:44.950 --> 09:47.469
Don't you want to try some
melon bread too, Master Vamp?

09:47.470 --> 09:50.819
Yeah, I wonder if they're
really that good here.

09:50.820 --> 09:53.429
I'll get in line for some too. Someone
has to keep an eye on Red anyway.

09:53.430 --> 09:54.569
Are you sure?

09:54.570 --> 09:56.849
Yeah. I'll hold on to your
shield and spear for you.

09:56.850 --> 09:59.989
Then we'll be back here in
forty-five minutes at... two thirty.

09:59.990 --> 10:00.840
Sure.

10:00.841 --> 10:01.949
Thank you!

10:01.950 --> 10:03.340
Have fun!

10:13.000 --> 10:14.989
Hold on a second, Mr. Red!

10:14.990 --> 10:15.960
Let go!

10:15.961 --> 10:18.309
I bought my bread so I'm done here.

10:18.310 --> 10:21.090
Just a little longer. I'm sure
Master Vamp's on his way here now.

10:21.370 --> 10:24.860
Why do I have to wait for you guys
when I'm the one being hunted down?

10:26.580 --> 10:27.599
What about Master Vamp?

10:27.600 --> 10:31.480
We looked everywhere around the dining utensils
store and the bookstore but we couldn't find him.

10:32.780 --> 10:34.919
Just hold on a while longer!

10:34.920 --> 10:36.899
Oh, sorry, sorry.

10:36.900 --> 10:39.059
Come on!

10:39.060 --> 10:40.060
That's enough!

10:43.820 --> 10:45.869
I did manage to bring them back,

10:45.870 --> 10:48.289
but I wonder if these
were really worth the effort.

10:48.290 --> 10:52.739
It's not bad, but I don't think
it's worth getting in line for.

10:52.740 --> 10:54.770
You're the one that made me get in line!

10:57.740 --> 10:58.909
Where am I?

10:58.910 --> 11:00.920
Is this the South Hall or the North Hall?

11:01.460 --> 11:03.980
This is why I hate Nikotama's Takajimaya!

11:04.690 --> 11:08.569
Master Vamp from Kawasaki,
your party is waiting for you.

11:08.570 --> 11:10.889
Please come to the information
desk located in the South Hall.

11:10.890 --> 11:12.950
How am I supposed to find that?

11:13.670 --> 11:15.269
Astro Fighter Sunred.

11:15.270 --> 11:17.349
This is a story of the
conflict between good and evil

11:17.350 --> 11:19.450
which takes place in the city of Kawasaki.

12:50.320 --> 12:51.830
Guess the line.
